<title>UK: Sainsbury to launch all-night shopping.</title>
<headline>Sainsbury to launch all-night shopping.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British supermarket chain J. Sainsbury Plc plans to launch all-night shopping at 25 of its biggest stores from the end of this month, The Times newspaper said.</p>
<p>The newspaper said in its Tuesday edition that the stores would stay open from 0700 GMT on Fridays to 2100 GMT on Saturdays, starting on June 27.</p>
<p>Several of Britain's major supermarket chains have been experimenting with all-night shopping.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
